# Mau cau hinh khoa ky ban phat hanh Android.
#
# Cach dung:
#   1. Tao khoa (chay mot lan, nho mat khau da dat):
#        keytool -genkey -v -keystore D:\khoa\fams-release.jks -storetype JKS \
#                -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000 -alias fams
#   2. Chep tep nay thanh android/key.properties roi dien lai 4 dong duoi.
#   3. Build: flutter build apk --release   hoac   flutter build appbundle --release
#
# Luu y:
#   - key.properties va tep .jks da nam trong .gitignore, tuyet doi khong dua len git.
#   - Mat khoa .jks thi khong the cap nhat app da phat hanh tren CH Play, hay sao luu
#     tep nay o noi an toan ngoai may lam viec.
#   - storeFile tinh tu thu muc android/ (vi du ../khoa/fams-release.jks) hoac ghi
#     duong dan tuyet doi.

storeFile=D:/khoa/fams-release.jks
storePassword=doi-mat-khau-nay
keyAlias=fams
keyPassword=doi-mat-khau-nay
